@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 35
hide stereotype
rectangle "A1 Static" as N0
rectangle "A2 Graph" as N1
rectangle "A3 LLM" as N2
rectangle "A4 Static + Graph" as N3
rectangle "A5 Static + LLM" as N4
rectangle "A6 Graph + LLM" as N5
rectangle "A7 Static + Graph + LLM" as N6
N0 -[hidden]right-> N1
N1 -[hidden]right-> N2
N2 -[hidden]down-> N3
N3 -[hidden]left-> N4
N4 -[hidden]left-> N5
N5 -[hidden]left-> N6
legend bottom
Сравнение зафиксировано на общей контролируемой выборке; не причинное
доказательство
endlegend
@enduml
